WEBVTT

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.344
Are you awake, 10th?

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:21.720
She will not let you
come to any harm.

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:24.314
She has pledged her loyalty to you,
and will serve you faithfully.

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:26.359
Her name is "Tiger."

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.284
Tiger...

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:33.922
Lord Faust...

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.357
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.927
| was born to be with you.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:10.270
The moment I awoke...

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:14.396
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:18.135
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:18.344 --> 00:01:21.644
I was born to hold you.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.818
Lies and truths...

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:28.945
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:33.726
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:35.562
...won't get to me.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:39.057
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:42.625
...can be ours once again!

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:47.166
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:51.074
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:54.478
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:59.246
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:17.596
They are, after all,
only marionettes.

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:21.833
They are incompetents who can't begin
to comprehend what true loyalty is.

00:02:22.709 --> 00:02:26.270
It is my personal conclusion
that the maiden circuits...

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:29.407
...only slow them down

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:33.112
...and a pointless state
of self-consciousness.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.245
You are suggesting that
they don't need hearts?

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.551
You may have a point.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:56.101
Gentleness,
Heartbreak, and Femininity

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:28.063
Lord Faust! Give that back!

00:03:28.141 --> 00:03:29.666
That's my hat!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.541
No way! If you want it back,
you'll have to take it from me!

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:35.982
You stop that, Lord Faust...!

00:03:40.587 --> 00:03:42.055
Ow...!

00:03:43.056 --> 00:03:46.026
It hurts really bad, Tiger!

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:49.256
Are you all right, Lord Faust?!

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.486
It hurts!

00:03:51.564 --> 00:03:54.363
Oh, come on.
It's just a little scrape.

00:03:55.034 --> 00:03:56.502
But, it hurts!

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:15.719
I've cast a magic spell on it.

00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:18.624
Now, it will heal soon!

00:04:25.198 --> 00:04:26.996
Here.

00:04:27.066 --> 00:04:29.501
If you like it that much,
you can keep it.

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:31.037
Really?

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:34.038
How does it look?

00:04:34.107 --> 00:04:35.871
Very stunning!

00:04:43.016 --> 00:04:44.484
Fuhrer!

00:04:47.153 --> 00:04:48.917
Tiger!

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:50.956
You took him to see
the flowers...?

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:53.857
It's no wonder that he's so weak!

00:04:53.926 --> 00:04:55.894
Who told you to coddle him?

00:04:56.896 --> 00:04:58.591
Forgive me, my Lord!

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:01.428
Become stronger, boy.
Kindness is for the weak!

00:05:02.001 --> 00:05:04.060
You must become stronger.

00:05:05.271 --> 00:05:07.137
STRONGER!

00:05:16.482 --> 00:05:18.450
NO!!

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:21.078
No! Stop it

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:25.091
It will be over soon, 10th.

00:05:27.226 --> 00:05:28.591
Tiger"!

00:05:28.895 --> 00:05:30.659
Tiger, help me!!

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:34.561
Tiger! TIGER!!

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:38.462
Begin.

00:05:49.816 --> 00:05:51.875
The future fuhrer of Gartlant...

00:05:52.051 --> 00:05:54.679
...must inherit the memories
of the previous generations.

00:05:57.357 --> 00:05:59.086
TIGER?!

00:06:00.993 --> 00:06:03.826
TIGER"!

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.098
TIG--!

00:06:12.638 --> 00:06:14.936
Stage one, complete.

00:06:24.817 --> 00:06:26.615
Lord Faust...?!

00:06:35.962 --> 00:06:40.422
He had to become stronger.
For the fate of all Gartlant...

00:06:41.868 --> 00:06:45.065
He has to change...

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:51.036
Work on the Sabelberg
has been completed.

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.401
The Sabelberg?

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:57.541
The fuhrer, in all his generosity, has
decided to give you one last chance.

00:06:58.785 --> 00:07:04.656
If and when you complete this
mission... return to his side once again.

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:09.122
Panther and Luchs are opting for the
mission... What is your decision?

00:07:13.733 --> 00:07:15.997
For the honor of the fuhrer,
Faust the 10th!

00:07:16.669 --> 00:07:20.731
Very well. Join up with Rubens
at the Japoness frontier...

00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:22.901
...and wait for instructions.

00:07:22.975 --> 00:07:23.806
Sir!

00:07:23.876 --> 00:07:26.345
"Kasahari Apartments”
Am I making myself clear, Lime?

00:07:26.846 --> 00:07:28.974
Once you've delivered these cakes,
you are to come STRAIGHT home.

00:07:29.048 --> 00:07:30.812
No stopping on the way!

00:07:30.883 --> 00:07:32.681
I can't stop to eat any?

00:07:32.752 --> 00:07:36.711
They're not for YOU, understand?!
This is a share for the Shogun!

00:07:36.789 --> 00:07:38.348
Oh. That's no fun.

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:42.622
Oh, yeah. And do your best to
mind your manners around him, got it?

00:07:42.695 --> 00:07:47.064
Got it! He means a lot to you,
so he means a lot to me, too.

00:07:47.233 --> 00:07:48.928
Good! Now, go!

00:07:49.001 --> 00:07:50.765
Okay, I'm going"

00:07:52.205 --> 00:07:54.936
Um... Master Otaru...?
What about this?

00:07:55.775 --> 00:07:57.971
Get back here, Lime!!

00:07:58.811 --> 00:08:00.040
You called?

00:08:00.112 --> 00:08:02.410
Have you forgotten
why you're going there?!

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:03.950
Oh, yeah.

00:08:06.886 --> 00:08:08.354
That's a big one!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.956
I think it's over.

00:08:13.025 --> 00:08:14.186
Yeah...

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:16.251
Okay, I'm going now!!

00:08:18.865 --> 00:08:20.833
LIME

00:08:26.572 --> 00:08:28.802
And, boy! Was he ever mad!

00:08:28.875 --> 00:08:30.741
Hey, you! You're in the
presence of the Shogun!

00:08:30.810 --> 00:08:32.209
Your feet, your feet!

00:08:32.278 --> 00:08:33.746
What's wrong with my feet?

00:08:33.813 --> 00:08:36.339
No one sits before the Shogun
cross-legged! Stop that!

00:08:36.415 --> 00:08:39.749
Oh, that's all right.
Lime is a friend. Right, Lime?

00:08:40.086 --> 00:08:41.554
Yup!

00:08:42.088 --> 00:08:44.955
Hey, Grampa? What's that
you're playing with?

00:08:45.391 --> 00:08:48.326
Now, stop that! He is not your
"Grampa,” he is the Shogun!

00:08:48.928 --> 00:08:51.693
I told you to never mind that. Enough!

00:08:51.764 --> 00:08:53.858
Yeah, never mind that! Enough!

00:08:56.602 --> 00:08:58.366
This is a shogi piece.

00:08:58.437 --> 00:09:01.498
We shall have to play a game
someday. It's quite fun.

00:09:02.575 --> 00:09:03.906
Okay!

00:09:03.976 --> 00:09:07.412
Well, now... Shall we eat some of
Cherry's special jam rice cakes?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.847
Okay! I'll make the tea!

00:09:10.416 --> 00:09:11.850
Oh, how kind of you!

00:09:11.918 --> 00:09:13.682
Never mind, never mind!

00:09:13.753 --> 00:09:15.721
You certainly are
good to me, Lime.

00:09:15.788 --> 00:09:17.950
Hey, Mister?
How do you work this pot?

00:09:18.024 --> 00:09:19.549
I'm not a "Mister,” dammit,
I am a "doctor™

00:09:20.459 --> 00:09:23.326
What splendid growth.

00:09:23.596 --> 00:09:25.826
No, no! He cannot drink that!!

00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:28.367
Sure he can! Here!

00:09:28.434 --> 00:09:30.402
Oh, that's unusual-looking tea.

00:09:30.469 --> 00:09:32.460
- It's really good!
- Let's have a taste.

00:09:32.538 --> 00:09:35.166
Shogun! For the love of God,
don't drink that!

00:09:36.242 --> 00:09:37.710
Ow!

00:09:38.511 --> 00:09:40.036
This earthquake...

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:42.348
It's abnormal!

00:09:43.449 --> 00:09:45.008
Find out where it is originating!

00:09:45.084 --> 00:09:46.574
Sir!

00:09:48.955 --> 00:09:51.981
"Peace Be Upon The Land"

00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:54.389
That sure was a big one,
wasn't it, Grampa!

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.952
It certainly was.
Lime, your shoulder!

00:09:57.964 --> 00:10:01.457
Oh, not again... It's been
acting up a lot recently...

00:10:01.534 --> 00:10:04.231
That's no good.
You should get it fixed.

00:10:04.303 --> 00:10:05.771
Yeah!

00:10:08.541 --> 00:10:12.000
Don't look at ME.
I only fix human beings.

00:10:12.878 --> 00:10:14.937
| can't repair marionettes.

00:10:15.615 --> 00:10:18.380
I know THAT!
I'm a marionette...

00:10:18.451 --> 00:10:21.352
.50 I have to see
a marionette doctor!

00:10:21.887 --> 00:10:23.878
Oh, yeah! All those
sparks just reminded me!

00:10:26.092 --> 00:10:27.821
Ta-dah! A firecracker!

00:10:27.893 --> 00:10:31.454
I bought it on the way here
so we could light it together!

00:10:31.764 --> 00:10:34.426
A firecracker? That sounds like fun.
All right, let's light it!

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:36.798
Yay! We get to light a firecracker!

00:10:36.869 --> 00:10:40.100
Shogun!!

00:10:40.172 --> 00:10:41.697
What's the meaning of this?!

00:10:41.774 --> 00:10:45.005
M'Lord! That last earthquake
was not a natural occurrence!

00:10:45.077 --> 00:10:49.105
A gigantic unidentified object is
advancing underground towards Japoness!

00:10:49.181 --> 00:10:52.344
We fear it may be a new
Gartlant secret weapon.

00:10:52.418 --> 00:10:54.113
What?!

00:11:21.847 --> 00:11:24.214
Oh, you will?!

00:11:24.283 --> 00:11:28.516
Yup! I'll get the others, and
we'll go find out what it is!

00:11:28.587 --> 00:11:31.682
The Guards of the Imperial Court are
unable to go. We're depending upon you.

00:11:32.091 --> 00:11:33.559
Okay! Leave it to us!

00:11:36.896 --> 00:11:39.126
Damn that Faust...
What's he up to this time?!

00:11:40.099 --> 00:11:42.466
Don't worry, Grampa!
We'll take care of it!

00:11:42.835 --> 00:11:46.465
"Dumplings”

00:11:49.742 --> 00:11:53.076
They're gone. Start the operation.
Do not to foul it up.

00:11:53.145 --> 00:11:54.613
Roger.

00:11:58.684 --> 00:12:01.381
Whoa, there's so much SPACE"

00:12:01.687 --> 00:12:03.553
Are you sure it's here, Cherry?

00:12:03.622 --> 00:12:06.091
Yes! It should be...

00:12:06.158 --> 00:12:07.648
There's nothing here.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:11.152
The moment we arrived,
my reading from it disappeared...

00:12:12.098 --> 00:12:13.532
DISAPPEARED?!

00:12:13.599 --> 00:12:16.432
Oh, come on now!

00:12:16.502 --> 00:12:18.937
It's a HUMONGOUS
object, remember?!

00:12:19.004 --> 00:12:22.065
Something like that can't
just DISAPPEAR into thin air.

00:12:22.141 --> 00:12:22.937
But...

00:12:23.008 --> 00:12:26.569
Are you sure your tracking circuit
isn't broken? Maybe it got moldy...

00:12:26.645 --> 00:12:30.411
...from disuse because of all the
time you spend in la-la land.

00:12:30.649 --> 00:12:33.482
H-H-H-Hey! Did I say anything
that wasn't true?! NO!

00:12:33.552 --> 00:12:35.042
R-R-Right, Otaru?

00:12:35.121 --> 00:12:36.111
Huh?

00:12:36.188 --> 00:12:39.818
Hey! What're you guys doing?
Let's set up for lunch over here!

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:53.004
Man, are these jam cakes good!

00:12:53.072 --> 00:12:55.006
Your cooking is as
awesome as always, Cherry!

00:12:55.074 --> 00:12:56.735
Oh, thank you!

00:12:56.809 --> 00:12:58.538
Still...

00:12:58.611 --> 00:13:03.344
Yeah. What's going on, anyways?
How can it vanish without a trace?

00:13:03.816 --> 00:13:07.150
Supposing that Cherry's tracking
circuit ISN'T broken, that means...

00:13:07.219 --> 00:13:10.849
...that the object either disappeared
suddenly or went somewhere out of range.

00:13:11.323 --> 00:13:14.088
But, it would have
had to go quite far...

00:13:14.693 --> 00:13:16.388
Yeah, it couldn't have
moved that quickly.

00:13:16.462 --> 00:13:18.362
HOW?! How can it be?!!

00:13:18.798 --> 00:13:21.563
That's what we're pondering
right now, silly.

00:13:21.634 --> 00:13:23.363
How can it have disappeared?

00:13:23.569 --> 00:13:25.037
NOT THAT™

00:13:25.104 --> 00:13:28.074
I mean, WHY JAM RICE CAKES, of all
things?! Japoness packed lunches...

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:31.303
...are based on rice balls! Also, they
should be served with sweet omelettes...

00:13:31.377 --> 00:13:33.277
...and those little
octopus-shaped wienies!

00:13:33.345 --> 00:13:36.280
This is just plain WRONG!
What's WRONG with you people?!!

00:13:36.348 --> 00:13:38.976
Aw, pipe down.
It tastes good, so who cares?

00:13:39.118 --> 00:13:40.586
| CARE"

00:13:41.654 --> 00:13:44.624
Some picnic THIS has
turned out to be...

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:47.557
This isn't a picnic. We're
hunting an unidentified object.

00:13:47.626 --> 00:13:49.116
Oh, we are?

00:13:51.764 --> 00:13:53.232
What's this?!

00:13:55.668 --> 00:13:58.501
"EPICENTER"

00:13:58.571 --> 00:14:00.164
Hard... Big... Round... Metal...

00:14:00.773 --> 00:14:02.969
I'm reading something large
and metallic directly below us!

00:14:03.042 --> 00:14:03.907
What?!

00:14:03.976 --> 00:14:06.911
| get it! It was burrowed
deep inside the earth.

00:14:06.979 --> 00:14:09.676
That's why your tracking circuit
didn't pick up anything!

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.850
What in the heck is this?

00:14:36.308 --> 00:14:38.037
You dogs...

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:41.637
So, all it took was a little
earthquake to thin out your guards...

00:14:42.214 --> 00:14:45.184
Some impregnable castle
THIS has turned out to be!

00:14:47.386 --> 00:14:51.345
We will kill you,
and regain favor with Lord Faust.

00:14:51.423 --> 00:14:54.620
Prepare yourself, because
this time, it's really over!

00:14:54.693 --> 00:14:56.354
Oh, really?

00:14:56.729 --> 00:14:59.255
You will not lay a
finger upon the Shogun.

00:14:59.331 --> 00:15:00.821
Fall in, fall in"!

00:15:07.206 --> 00:15:08.332
Don't waste my time.

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:10.375
Orange Blossoms,
protect the Shogun!

00:15:14.079 --> 00:15:15.911
Why are we running
directly in its path?!

00:15:15.981 --> 00:15:17.471
Do you have a
death wish, Otaru?!

00:15:17.549 --> 00:15:20.917
Our job is to find out
what this thing is, dummy!

00:15:20.986 --> 00:15:22.454
Yeah, but still!!

00:15:48.747 --> 00:15:52.513
They're going through our new sabers
as though they weren't there!

00:15:52.584 --> 00:15:54.052
I don't believe it.

00:15:54.119 --> 00:15:58.386
It's their hearts! They are using
the emotion "wrath” as a weapon!

00:16:21.113 --> 00:16:24.276
Master Otaru, running away from it
like this won't get us anywhere!

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.250
Yes, I know that!

00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:28.286
Want me to go take a look at it?

00:16:28.354 --> 00:16:31.255
No, that won't be necessary!
You'll love this, Hanagata!

00:16:31.523 --> 00:16:32.319
Huh?!

00:16:32.391 --> 00:16:35.986
It's time for me to pass the
"Hero of Japoness" title on to you!

00:16:36.061 --> 00:16:38.029
- Do it, Bloodberry!
- GOTCHA!

00:16:39.665 --> 00:16:41.633
What are you doing?!?

00:16:41.767 --> 00:16:43.826
You go and check it out!

00:16:43.902 --> 00:16:45.370
But, that's ridiculous!!!

00:16:49.108 --> 00:16:52.373
We have no alternative but to
awaken Baiko and Tamasaburo!

00:16:52.444 --> 00:16:53.809
Out of the question.

00:16:53.879 --> 00:16:55.608
Shogun?!

00:16:55.681 --> 00:16:59.777
Even if we haven't a hope in hell,
we can't let Japoness end this way.

00:17:07.026 --> 00:17:08.551
Prepare yourself, leyasu.

00:17:44.029 --> 00:17:45.656
It stopped.

00:17:45.731 --> 00:17:47.028
What happened?

00:17:47.099 --> 00:17:49.693
Who cares what happened?!?
PUT ME DOWNM

00:17:53.105 --> 00:17:56.564
Its armor is extremely thick.
Also, its systems are very complex.

00:17:56.642 --> 00:17:58.542
It will take some time
for me to analyze...

00:18:00.579 --> 00:18:02.047
Fireworks?

00:18:03.248 --> 00:18:04.875
Grampa...!

00:18:26.839 --> 00:18:28.739
Mission complete. Pull back.

00:18:39.017 --> 00:18:40.576
- Grampa!!
- Shogun?!

00:18:41.086 --> 00:18:42.645
Mr. Hikozaemon!!

00:18:42.721 --> 00:18:45.088
Grampa! Grampa, say something!!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.087
No...

00:18:51.864 --> 00:18:53.696
Grampa!

00:18:53.765 --> 00:18:55.665
Grampa, wake up!

00:18:57.136 --> 00:18:59.070
Oh, it's you, Lime...

00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:01.971
That's right! It's me, Grampa!

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:05.704
Was the firecracker pretty, Lime...?

00:19:06.712 --> 00:19:08.180
Grampa?!

00:19:09.148 --> 00:19:10.582
Shogun!!

00:19:12.985 --> 00:19:16.819
Doctor! Grampa's been
hurt really bad! Hurry!

00:19:24.062 --> 00:19:28.295
Hey, what are you waiting for?!
You've got to fix him, quick!

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:30.029
IT'S TOO LATE!

00:19:32.070 --> 00:19:34.061
What do you mean,
IT'S TOO LATE?!

00:19:34.139 --> 00:19:37.109
He's still breathing!
He's not dead"

00:19:37.409 --> 00:19:38.535
FIX Him!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.602
You can fix him by giving him medicine
or a shot or something, can't you?!

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.310
Come on, fix him!"!

00:19:44.383 --> 00:19:45.976
Lime...

00:19:46.051 --> 00:19:49.214
Aren't you a doctor
that fixes human beings?!

00:19:49.288 --> 00:19:51.586
He's a human, so you
should be able to fix him!

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:53.924
Lime, stop it.

00:19:53.992 --> 00:19:57.189
Help him! Come on, help him!

00:19:57.763 --> 00:19:59.527
I can't...

00:19:59.598 --> 00:20:01.032
But, why?

00:20:01.099 --> 00:20:02.294
WHY CAN'T YOU?!

00:20:02.367 --> 00:20:03.835
LIME!

00:20:05.003 --> 00:20:06.630
Otaru...

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:09.933
Listen to me, Lime...

00:20:10.008 --> 00:20:12.375
Humans can't be repaired
like marionettes can.

00:20:13.812 --> 00:20:17.840
Humans can't live forever...
..like marionettes can.

00:20:18.984 --> 00:20:20.645
Otaru...

00:20:27.326 --> 00:20:28.794
It's here!

00:20:46.011 --> 00:20:48.981
I'm reading a large quantity of
plasma energy from inside it.

00:20:49.047 --> 00:20:50.412
It's...!

00:20:50.482 --> 00:20:52.143
-IT'S A BOMB!
- WHAT?!

00:20:54.019 --> 00:20:56.579
If something that big were to explode...

00:20:56.655 --> 00:20:58.953
...Japoness would be finished.

00:20:59.024 --> 00:21:00.492
Grampa...

00:21:05.998 --> 00:21:08.126
"KING"

00:21:10.102 --> 00:21:12.002
Adios, leyasu.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:14.801
I thought that your journey to the
other side would be a lonely one...

00:21:14.873 --> 00:21:17.501
...so |I arranged for you to
have some travelling companions.

00:21:17.576 --> 00:21:20.409
I'll eradicate all that is Japoness
from the face of the planet™!

00:21:28.487 --> 00:21:32.446
GRAMPA!M

00:22:00.585 --> 00:22:04.317
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:04.389 --> 00:22:08.053
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:08.193 --> 00:22:11.094
Just think of me...

00:22:11.163 --> 00:22:15.760
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:16.001 --> 00:22:19.733
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:19.805 --> 00:22:23.469
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:23.642 --> 00:22:27.408
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:27.479 --> 00:22:29.208
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:29.281 --> 00:22:33.218
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:37.618
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:37.689 --> 00:22:42.684
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:42.894 --> 00:22:46.489
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:46.698 --> 00:22:50.328
...one step at a time.

00:22:50.569 --> 00:22:54.164
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:54.239 --> 00:22:58.039
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:58.176 --> 00:23:01.737
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:08.076
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:17.095 --> 00:23:18.460
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:21.295
Grampa leyasu... We're
going to protect the city...

00:23:21.366 --> 00:23:23.300
...the city that you built!

00:23:23.368 --> 00:23:27.236
Get lost, saber dolls!
We haven't got time to fight you!

00:23:27.672 --> 00:23:29.572
That voice...

00:23:29.641 --> 00:23:31.973
Grampa...? Grampa, is that you?!?

00:23:32.043 --> 00:23:34.102
A secret weapon that
will save Japoness...?

00:23:34.179 --> 00:23:36.170
Where?! Tell us where it is!

00:23:36.248 --> 00:23:41.277
Castle, Transform! Rise, Japonessguar!
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:41.353 --> 00:23:43.378
I love you, Otaru!
